e prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Logan County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, September to October and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 33 of those years. In 2025, August to September on the middle of the grids came in at 69% of normal, and in 2026 so far March to April sits at 62%. Grid 21192 had its driest year in 1953, at 70% of normal.</p>"}
